#. TRANSLATORS: the * and ? characters are the ASCII wildcard special symbols,
#. and they must not be localized.
#: thunar/thunar-standard-view.c:3074
msgctxt "Select by Pattern dialog: tooltips: pattern entry text box"
msgid ""
"? matches exactly one character,\n"
"* matches any number of characters, including zero.\n"
"\n"
"For example: *.txt, file??.png, pict\n"
"\n"
"Without any * or ? wildcards, the pattern will match anywhere in a name. With wildcards, the pattern must match at both the start and the end of a name."
msgstr "? karaktere bakar batekin bat dator,\n* edozein karaktere kopururekin bat dator, zero barne.\n\nAdibidez: *.txt, fitx??.png, argaz\n\n* edo ? komodinik gabe, ereduak izenaren edozein lekutan egin dezake bat. Komodinekin, ereduak izenaren hasieran eta amaieran egin behar du bat."

