#: thunar/thunar-uca-editor.ui:298
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want a waiting cursor to be shown while the action"
" is launched. This is also highly recommended if you have focus stealing "
"prevention enabled in your window manager."
msgstr "Gaitu aukera hau ekintza abiarazten den bitartean itxaroteko kurtsorea erakustea nahi baduzu. Oso gomendagarria da, halaber, leiho-kudeatzailean fokua lapurtzearen aurkako babesa gaituta baduzu."

